# The six functors

The six operations `f^*`, `f_*`, `f_!`, `f^!`, `⊗` and `RHom` on `ℓ`-adic derived
categories, the projection formulas, duality, and the preservation of constructibility
and of finite Tor-dimension, assembled into the six-operations package consumed by
smooth purity, Poincaré duality, the trace formula and the final chapter.

The étale and pro-étale operations themselves are constructed in
`WeilConjectures.SixFunctors`; statements here cite that tree instead of redeclaring
them.

Blueprint block `sec-six-functors`.
